<title>SOUTH AFRICA: NSA yr shr surges, no div.</title>
<headline>NSA yr shr surges, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     63.0	  vs 41.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   33.54	 vs 8.96</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   19.14	 vs 4.89</p>
<p>    Tax			 6.83	  vs 1.71</p>
<p>Full name: NSA Investments Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - No dividend was declared. Directors said while the company was new and growing it was policy to reinvest earnings to enhance existing or acquire new investments. As the company matured, a dividend declaration would be considered.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
